<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NORMA IN NEW SUPPLY DEAL WITH AUTO VAZ.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NORMA IN NEW SUPPLY DEAL WITH AUTO VAZ.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norma, an automotive components maunfacturer, said on Monday that it has concluded a new supply agreement with Russian car maker Auto Vaz.</p>
<p>The agreement is 20 percent larger than the previous year's arrangement, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company will supply over two million seat belts to the Vaz factory. Auto Vaz hopes for production to reach 716,000 new cars this year, Norma said.</p>
<p>Most of Norma's seat belt production supplies the Russian car makers.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
